            <h3 class="text-widget-title">Lead-Based Paint Safety (Pre-1978)</h3>
          </header>
          <div class="calc-field-group">
            <p class="text-body">Homes built before 1978 require mandatory federal lead disclosures (Form 22J) and lead-safe wet-sanding practices during cosmetic remodels to prevent toxic dust exposure.</p>
