            <a href="/realestate/resources/healthhazards/lead-asbestos/" class="btn btn-secondary"><span>Read Full Guide &rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="surface-bento calc-strategy-card radar-result-node" data-trigger-type="year_built_before" data-trigger-key="1981">
          <header class="text-center">
            <div class="text-overline text-accent-alpine">PROPERTY HEALTH</div>
            <h3 class="text-widget-title">Asbestos Building Materials (Pre-1980)</h3>
          </header>
          <div class="calc-field-group">
            <p class="text-body">Acoustic popcorn ceilings, vinyl floor tiles, and pipe insulation from this era may contain asbestos. PSCAA regulations require certified surveys before demolition.</p>
