            <h3 class="text-widget-title">Underground Heating Oil Tank &amp; PLIA Grants</h3>
          </header>
          <div class="calc-field-group">
            <p class="text-body">Un-decommissioned oil tanks risk groundwater leakage. Verify Fire Department decommissioning certificates or register with WA PLIA for up to $75,000 in cleanup grants.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="action-tray-constrained section-action-tray">
            <a href="/realestate/resources/healthhazards/heating-oil/" class="btn btn-secondary"><span>Read Full Guide &rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
