            <h3 class="text-widget-title">Private Well Water &amp; Septic RSS Inspections</h3>
          </header>
          <div class="calc-field-group">
            <p class="text-body">King and Snohomish counties strictly mandate a licensed Septic Report of System Status (RSS) transfer inspection prior to closing. Ensure private well potability is tested.</p>
