            <div class="text-overline text-accent-alpine">PROPERTY HEALTH</div>
            <h3 class="text-widget-title">WA Mandatory Resale Safety Compliance</h3>
          </header>
          <div class="calc-field-group">
            <p class="text-body">Every property transaction in Washington State requires operational smoke detectors, carbon monoxide alarms on every floor, and seismically double-strapped hot water heaters prior to closing.</p>
